<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #000000; padding: 20px;">
    <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

    <p>Your spot for EGM Split 2026 has been successfully assigned as <i>{{spotType}}</i>.</p>

    <div style="{{show_payment}}">
        <p>You need to pay <i>{{price}}</i>€.</p>

        <p>Your reference number is <i>{{reference}}</i>. You can also consult it in the EGM App.</p>

        <p>In order to proceed with the registration process, we need you to pay the spot until the {{deadline}}, following one of these steps:</p>

        <p><strong>1. Payment by card</strong></p>
        <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
            <p>To pay by card you will need to go to the EGM App and select the 'Pay with Stripe' option on your user page. <strong>You'll be charged a percentage because of the commissions of the platform if using this method.</strong></p>
            <p>If you're paying for yourself...</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Add your the Reference Number* and Name + Surname + National Organisation. For example, Marco Natali ESN Italy</li>
                <li>Add the TAX DATA of the ENTITY/SECTION that will receive the legal invoice after the event - to do so, select the option 'buying as a company' in the bottom of the Stripe payment form.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p><strong>2. Payment by bank transfer</strong></p>
        <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
            <p>To pay by bank transfer, these are the fields you must fill when processing your transfer:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Concept of the payment: <u>NAME SURNAME - REFERENCE NUMBER - EGM SPLIT 2026</u> (<i>ex: Marco Natali - 123456789 - EGM Split 2026</i>)</li>
                <li>If you are paying for multiple people, send an email to <a href="mailto:egm-oc@esn.org">egm-oc@esn.org</a> with the proof of payment and the <u>NAME SURNAME - REFERENCE NUMBER</u> for EACH one paid on that transfer</li>
            </ul>

            <p style="margin-left: 20px;">ESN Split bank details:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Beneficiary:</strong> Erasmus studentska mreža Split</li>
              <li><strong>Beneficiary address:</strong> Ruđera Boškovića 31, 21000 Split, Croatia</li>
              <li><strong>Bank name:</strong> OTP banka</li>
              <li><strong>Bank address:</strong> Domovinskog rata 61, 21000 Split, Croatia</li>
              <li><strong>IBAN:</strong> HR4524070001100427189</li>
              <li><strong>SWIFT CODE:</strong> OTPVHR2X</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Remember to upload your proof of payment using the dedicated button on the user's page on the app. This should be a bank statement with the relevant data to match with your payment (name and surname and reference number).</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p>If you have any questions regarding the registration or payment process please write to <a href="mailto:egm-oc@esn.org">egm-oc@esn.org</a>.</p>
</body>
</html>